+1.  **Frustum Overlap ($O$):** The Intersection over Union (IoU) of the viewing frustums $A$ and $B$ of two cameras $E_1$ and $E_2$:
     $$ O(E_1, E_2) = \frac{|A \cap B|}{|A \cup B|} $$
-    where $| \cdot |$ denotes the volume.
