-2.  **Pose Distance ($D$):** The sum of Euclidean distance between centers and angular difference between orientations [S1]:
-    $$ D(E_1, E_2) = \|t_1 - t_2\|_2 + \arccos\left(\frac{\text{Tr}(R_2^T R_1) - 1}{2}\right) $$
