+2.  **Geometric Distance ($D$):** The sum of Euclidean distance between camera centers and the angular difference between orientations:
+    $$ D(E_1, E_2) = \|t_1 - t_2\|_2 + \arccos\left(\frac{\text{Tr}(R_2^\top R_1) - 1}{2}\right) $$
+    [S1]
